1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:08,994
Two companies in the same tax group: does an invoice between them need e-invoicing from January 2027?

2
00:00:08,994 --> 00:00:10,426
For two years, no.

3
00:00:11,126 --> 00:00:24,075
Under Ministerial Decision No. 197 of 2026, these transactions are excluded for 24 months, from 1 January 2027.

4
00:00:24,775 --> 00:00:32,711
The decision also drops the rule to store e-invoice data in the UAE, and the system-failure notice.

5
00:00:33,411 --> 00:00:41,710
